Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:24:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 074/128] dt-bindings: pwm: mediatek,mt2712-pwm: Add MT6858

The MT6858's general-purpose PWM has the MT6991 layout: four channels
with registers at 0x100 + 0x100 * n and the 26 MHz select at 0x74, as
the stock driver's version-3 paths show. Add it with an MT6991 fallback.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml
index fc31758a4..f391eb1d7 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,mt2712-pwm.yaml
@@ -35,6 +35,7 @@ properties:
           - const: mediatek,mt8183-pwm
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - mediatek,mt6858-pwm
               - mediatek,mt8196-pwm
           - const: mediatek,mt6991-pwm
 
